<title>SPAIN: Banesto details 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>Banesto details 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>				    (billion pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit/loss			  26.04   vs     21.37</p>
<p> Pretax profit/loss		     27.57   vs     21.37</p>
<p> Net interest income		   129.68   vs    133.64</p>
<p> Ordinary income			 190.19   vs    178.02</p>
<p> Operating income			44.56    vs     29.34</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the bank is Banesto Group.  </p>
<p>Fees and commissions		    42.88  vs  41.07</p>
<p>Financial/trading income		17.63  vs   3.31</p>
<p>Operating costs</p>
<p>   -personnel costs		     95.64  vs  99.00</p>
<p>   -general, administrative costs   33.73  vs  37.20</p>
<p>Depreciation				17.63  vs  20.81</p>
<p>Other operating income		   1.36  vs   8.32</p>
<p>Net earnings from equity-accounted</p>
<p>holdings				    -3.72  vs  11.74</p>
<p>Amortisation of goodwill		 2.51  vs   0.81</p>
<p>Net loan-loss provisions		 12.67 vs  18.62</p>
<p>Net extraordinary gaines/losses	1.91  vs  -0.28</p>
<p>Corporate income tax		     1.53  vs   nil</p>
<p>Minorities				   1.43  vs   0.65</p>
</text>
